msgid "Quick start"
msgstr "快速上手"

msgid "From launch to an exported figure: choose the correct assembly, find a locus, inspect transcripts, import experimental data, and compare or export the view. The examples below use the human ``hg38`` assembly."
msgstr "从启动到导出图像：选择正确的装配，查找位点，检查转录本，导入实验数据，并比较或导出视图。以下示例使用人类 ``hg38`` 装配。"

msgid "1. Choose an assembly"
msgstr "1. 选择装配"

msgid "Click the assembly name beside the Orbit logo in the top toolbar."
msgstr "点击顶部工具栏中 Orbit 标志旁的装配名称。"

msgid "Select **hg38** from the assembly list and wait for the assembly label and annotation to update."
msgstr "从装配列表中选择  hg38 ，等待装配标签和注释更新。"

msgid "Check the assembly before searching or importing data. Your experimental files must use the same coordinate system; changing the selector does not convert a file between assemblies."
msgstr "在搜索或导入数据前检查装配。实验文件必须使用相同的坐标系；切换选择器不会在不同装配之间转换文件。"

msgid "Changing assembly opens that assembly's default region, not the previous locus. Repeat your search after an assembly change. See :doc:`assemblies` for assembly names and sequence availability."
msgstr "切换装配会打开该装配的默认区域，而不是之前的位点。切换装配后请重新搜索。装配名称和序列可用性见  :doc:`assemblies` 。"

msgid "2. Open a locus"
msgstr "2. 打开位点"

msgid "Click the main search box, type ``TP53``, and press :kbd:`Enter`. Suggestions appear while you type; click a result or use :kbd:`↑` / :kbd:`↓` and :kbd:`Enter` to choose one. A gene search opens the gene with flanking context. You can also enter a coordinate with its chromosome name:"
msgstr "点击主搜索框，输入 ``TP53``，然后按  :kbd:`Enter` 。输入时会出现建议；点击结果，或使用  :kbd:`↑`  /  :kbd:`↓`  和  :kbd:`Enter`  进行选择。基因搜索会打开带侧翼上下文的基因。也可以输入带染色体名称的坐标："

msgid "Search coordinates are 1-based, with an inclusive end. Do not omit the chromosome name. Drag horizontally in a track canvas to pan; use the mouse wheel to zoom around the pointer, double-click to zoom in, or click **+** / **-** in the toolbar to zoom around the centre."
msgstr "搜索坐标从 1 开始，终点包含在内。不要省略染色体名称。在轨道画布中水平拖动可平移；使用鼠标滚轮围绕指针缩放，双击放大，或点击工具栏中的  +  /  -  围绕中心缩放。"

msgid "Orbit toolbar, track sidebar, and main genome-view canvas."
msgstr "Orbit 工具栏、轨道侧栏和主基因组视图画布。"

msgid "This overview shows the complete ``ACTB`` gene on hg38. Start at the top-left assembly selector, then use the adjacent search box. Import, Split, and Export are separate toolbar buttons; track visibility and selected-gene details are controlled in the left sidebar."
msgstr "此概览显示 hg38 上完整的 ``ACTB`` 基因。从左上角的装配选择器开始，然后使用旁边的搜索框。Import、Split 和 Export 是独立的工具栏按钮；轨道可见性和所选基因详情在左侧栏中控制。"

msgid "3. Look at the tracks"
msgstr "3. 查看轨道"

msgid "Expand **Tracks** in the left sidebar to reveal the built-in checkboxes. Ideogram, Ruler, RefSeq genes, and the compact whole-genome overview are on by default. **GC content** and **Sequence** start off. They require a reference sequence source for the assembly; their checkboxes are disabled if none is available. After enabling Sequence, zoom in to approximately ``1.2 bp/px`` or closer to see bases."
msgstr "展开左侧栏中的  Tracks  以显示内置复选框。染色体示意图、标尺、RefSeq 基因和紧凑的全基因组概览默认开启。 GC 含量  和  序列  默认关闭。它们需要该装配的参考序列源；如果没有可用序列，复选框会被禁用。启用序列后，放大到约 ``1.2 bp/px`` 或更近即可查看碱基。"

msgid "To see transcript structure:"
msgstr "查看转录本结构："

msgid "Click the ``TP53`` model or its label in the canvas. **Selection / details** shows its coordinates, strand, length, and transcript table."
msgstr "点击画布中的 ``TP53`` 模型或其标签。 选择 / 详情  会显示其坐标、链、长度和转录本表。"

msgid "Click the small **+** beside the gene to expand its transcript rows; click **-** there to collapse it. A single-transcript gene has no expansion button. The sidebar also offers **Show / Hide transcripts** for the selected gene."
msgstr "点击基因旁的小  +  展开其转录本行；点击  -  折叠。单转录本基因没有展开按钮。侧栏还为选定基因提供  显示 / 隐藏转录本 。"

msgid "To expand the whole RefSeq track, click the **gear** in its track-label cell, choose **Expand all**, then **Done**. Choose **Collapse all** to return to merged gene models. The same controls exist on imported GTF/GFF gene tracks."
msgstr "要展开整个 RefSeq 轨道，请点击其轨道标签格中的  齿轮 ，选择  全部展开 ，然后点击  完成 。选择  全部折叠  可恢复合并的基因模型。导入的 GTF/GFF 基因轨道也有相同控件。"

msgid "Gene models expanded into individual transcript rows in Orbit."
msgstr "Orbit 中展开为独立转录本行的基因模型。"

msgid "The ``EGFR`` example on hg38 shows transcripts in separate rows instead of one merged gene model. Search ``EGFR`` to reproduce this view. Use the per-gene plus/minus button for one gene, or the track gear's Expand all / Collapse all buttons for the entire annotation track."
msgstr "hg38 上的 ``EGFR`` 示例将转录本显示在不同的行中，而不是合并为一个基因模型。搜索 ``EGFR`` 可重现此视图。使用单个基因的加号/减号按钮，或使用轨道齿轮中的全部展开 / 全部折叠按钮操作整个注释轨道。"

msgid "4. Load your own data"
msgstr "4. 载入自己的数据"

msgid "With the matching assembly selected, click **Import** in the top toolbar and choose a local file, or drag the file onto the window. Accepted formats include bigWig, bedGraph, SEG, BAM, GTF/GFF, BED/peak files, and FASTA; see :doc:`data-import` for format-specific requirements."
msgstr "选中匹配的装配后，点击顶部工具栏中的**导入**并选择本地文件，或将文件拖到窗口中。支持的格式包括 bigWig、bedGraph、SEG、BAM、GTF/GFF、BED/peak 文件和 FASTA；格式要求见 :doc:`data-import`。"

msgid "Wait until the import progress panel reports completion. Signal files appear under **Signal tracks**; annotations and FASTA appear under **Imported**. Confirm that the new track's checkbox is on."
msgstr "等待导入进度面板报告完成。信号文件会出现在  信号轨道  下；注释和 FASTA 会出现在  已导入  下。确认新轨道的复选框已开启。"

msgid "Navigate to a region covered by the file. A track with no data at ``TP53`` is not necessarily an import failure. To search your own annotation instead of the bundled RefSeq index, open the scope dropdown at the left edge of the search box and choose **All imported** or a specific GTF/GFF track."
msgstr "跳到文件实际覆盖的区域。某个轨道在 ``TP53`` 没有数据，并不一定是导入失败。如果想搜自己的注释而不是内置 RefSeq 索引，打开搜索框左端范围内的下拉，选择 **全部导入** 或某个具体的 GTF/GFF 轨道。"

msgid "For a signal or gene track, click its **gear** (or right-click its canvas track label) for settings. Signal settings include colour, automatic/fixed range, log scale, and grouping. Gene settings include transcript expansion and feature colours. FASTA rows instead have strand and translation buttons."
msgstr "对于信号或基因轨道，点击其  齿轮 （或右键点击画布中的轨道标签）打开设置。信号设置包括颜色、自动/固定范围、对数刻度和分组。基因设置包括转录本展开和特征颜色。FASTA 行则有链和翻译按钮。"

msgid "Use real files generated for your chosen reference assembly. The import examples in :doc:`data-import` use ``Scr_R1_IP.bw`` (signal) and ``SRR22507537.chr1.bam`` (alignments) on hg38. To inspect the BAM example, search ``MTHFR`` or ``CLCN6`` on chromosome 1, not ``TP53``. The annotation example ``representative_transcripts.gtf`` instead requires the yeast **sacCer3** assembly. These filenames identify the example inputs; use your own local files unless you have those datasets."
msgstr "请使用与所选参考装配对应的真实文件。:doc:`data-import` 里的导入示例用 hg38 上的 ``Scr_R1_IP.bw`` （信号）和 ``SRR22507537.chr1.bam`` （比对）。要看 BAM 示例，请在第 1 号染色体上搜 ``MTHFR`` 或 ``CLCN6``，而不是 ``TP53``。注释示例 ``representative_transcripts.gtf`` 需要酵母 **sacCer3** 装配。这些文件名只是标明示例输入，没有对应数据集时请用自己的文件。"

msgid "Importing copies files into Orbit's data area. On a fresh page load, previously imported tracks remain listed but unchecked; tick them again instead of assuming they were deleted."
msgstr "导入会将文件复制到 Orbit 的数据区域。重新加载页面时，以前导入的轨道仍会列出但默认未勾选；请重新勾选，不要以为它们已被删除。"

msgid "If you work on a non-model organism, you do not need a catalog entry: choose the empty **Custom** assembly and import your own genome FASTA followed by its GFF3/GTF. :doc:`assemblies` walks through it with screenshots."
msgstr "如果做的是非模式物种，不必先建 catalog 条目：选空的 **自定义** 装配，先导入自己的基因组 FASTA，再导入 GFF3/GTF。:doc:`assemblies` 里有带截图的完整流程。"

msgid "Compare several loci"
msgstr "比较多个位点"

msgid "Click **Split** and choose **1 panel** through **5 panels**. New panels initially copy the active locus. Edit each panel's **Locus** field and press :kbd:`Enter`, or enter ``TP53, BRCA1`` in the main search box to open those matches side by side automatically (at most five terms)."
msgstr "点击  分屏  并选择  1 个面板  到  5 个面板 。新面板最初会复制活动位点。编辑每个面板的  位点  字段并按  :kbd:`Enter` ，或者在主搜索框中输入 ``TP53, BRCA1``，自动并排打开这些匹配项（最多五个词）。"

msgid "Click a panel's position cell to make it active before using the main search, keyboard navigation, or toolbar zoom. Dragging and pointer-based zoom operate on the panel under the pointer. Close one panel with its **x** button or choose **1 panel** to return to a single view. All panels share the assembly and track list; their loci and zoom levels are independent."
msgstr "在使用主搜索、键盘导航或工具栏缩放前，点击某个面板的位置单元格使其处于活动状态。拖动和基于指针的缩放作用于指针所在的面板。点击面板的  x  按钮关闭一个面板，或选择  1 个面板  返回单视图。所有面板共享装配和轨道列表，但位点和缩放级别彼此独立。"

msgid "Four independent locus panels with individual coordinate fields."
msgstr "带有独立坐标字段的四个位点面板。"

msgid "Four-panel comparison of ``ACTB``, ``EGFR``, ``TP53``, and ``MYC`` on hg38. Reproduce it by submitting ``ACTB, EGFR, TP53, MYC`` in the main search box. The Locus row supplies one coordinate input and close button per panel; its highlighted cell identifies the target of main-search and keyboard actions."
msgstr "hg38 上 ``ACTB``、``EGFR``、``TP53`` 和 ``MYC`` 的四面板比较。在主搜索框中提交 ``ACTB, EGFR, TP53, MYC`` 可重现该视图。位点行向每个面板提供一个坐标输入和关闭按钮；高亮单元格标识主搜索和键盘操作的目标。"

msgid "5. Export the view"
msgstr "5. 导出视图"

msgid "Finish choosing visible tracks, transcript expansion, and panel positions."
msgstr "完成可见轨道、转录本展开状态和面板位置的设置。"

msgid "Click **Export**, the download-arrow toolbar button immediately after **Split**."
msgstr "点击  导出 ，它是  分屏  后紧邻的下载箭头工具栏按钮。"

msgid "Keep **Include track labels** checked for labelled track rows, or clear it for just the drawing area; then choose **PNG**, **SVG**, or **PDF**."
msgstr "对于带标签的轨道行，保留  包含轨道标签  的勾选；若只需绘图区则取消勾选，然后选择  PNG 、 SVG  或  PDF 。"

msgid "Save the file through the desktop save dialog or your browser's download handler. Export captures displayed track rows and all current panels, not the sidebar or toolbar."
msgstr "通过桌面保存对话框或浏览器下载处理程序保存文件。导出会包含显示的轨道行和当前所有面板，不包含侧栏或工具栏。"

msgid "PNG is a 2x raster image. SVG is editable vector output. PDF is vector with an embedded font when a CJK font is available; otherwise Orbit reports a raster PDF fallback. See :doc:`data-export` for details."
msgstr "PNG 是 2 倍光栅图像。SVG 是可编辑的矢量输出。PDF 是矢量格式；有 CJK 字体时会嵌入字体，否则 Orbit 会报告使用光栅 PDF 回退。详情见  :doc:`data-export` 。"

msgid "Keyboard essentials"
msgstr "常用快捷键"

msgid "These navigation keys work when focus is outside text inputs and the Motif dialog is closed. They affect the active panel."
msgstr "当焦点不在文本输入框且 Motif 对话框关闭时，以下导航键有效。它们作用于活动面板。"

msgid "Key"
msgstr "按键"

msgid "Action"
msgstr "动作"

msgid ":kbd:`←` / :kbd:`→`"
msgstr " :kbd:`←`  /  :kbd:`→` "

msgid "Pan left / right by 35% of the current window"
msgstr "按当前窗口宽度的 35% 向左 / 向右平移"

msgid ":kbd:`+` / :kbd:`=`"
msgstr ":kbd:`+` / :kbd:`=`"

msgid "Zoom in twofold around the centre"
msgstr "围绕中心放大两倍"

msgid ":kbd:`-` / :kbd:`_`"
msgstr ":kbd:`-` / :kbd:`_`"

msgid "Zoom out twofold around the centre"
msgstr "围绕中心缩小两倍"

msgid ":kbd:`/`"
msgstr " :kbd:`/` "

msgid "Focus the main locus search box and select its contents"
msgstr "聚焦主位点搜索框并选中其内容"

msgid ":kbd:`Esc`"
msgstr " :kbd:`Esc` "

msgid "Dismiss settings/context popovers; outside an input, clear gene selection"
msgstr "关闭设置/上下文弹出框；在输入框外清除基因选择"

msgid "Use the toolbar **Export** button, not :kbd:`Ctrl+S`. Orbit does not bind :kbd:`Ctrl+F`, :kbd:`Ctrl+S`, or a special Shift-plus-arrow pan step."
msgstr "使用工具栏的  导出  按钮，而不是  :kbd:`Ctrl+S` 。Orbit 不绑定  :kbd:`Ctrl+F` 、 :kbd:`Ctrl+S` ，也没有特殊的 Shift 加方向键平移步长。"
